    <briefdescription>
<para>Fluent builder for <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_composite" kindref="compound">ToolboxComposite</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Routes are stored in insertion order; call <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_composite_builder_1ac8f113d537f2618b9d16ca0bf254f4f1" kindref="member">addRoute()</ref></computeroutput> multiple times. At least one route or a fallback must be provided before <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_composite_builder_1a034a1c02bf086e8a271753a6dc663fc8" kindref="member">build()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>composite<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_composite_builder_1aab73a8af5038653161851ec07eca5567" kindref="member">ToolboxCompositeBuilder</ref>()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.addRoute(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;text/html&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/>html_toolbox)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.addRoute(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;text/&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>text_toolbox)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.setFallback(default_toolbox)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.build();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
